 "text": "Hey, good to have you along, though. Think about what you value in a running companion, and go from there. A buddie to run with, a bottle of your favorite fruit juice, or running shoes? Before work is great, as it fits so many different schedules. Winter running sees the mornings get shorter, so it feels darker. A headlamp so you can see and be seen, and a pair of thick gloves so your hands don't get cold. A small bottle of your favorite fruit juice as motivation.",
